{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06260","headline":"渡汉江 · 丘爲","name":"渡汉江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漾舟汉江上，挂席候风生。\n临泛何容与，爱此江水清。\n芦洲隐遥嶂，露日隐孤城。\n自顾疎野性，难忘鸥鸟情。\n聊复与时顾，暂欲解尘缨。\n跋涉非吾愿，虚怀浩已盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}